              "start": 122,
              "end": 146,
              "quote": "下面是一些值得遵循的建议，可以帮你更有效地沟通。"
            },
            {
              "paragraphId": "zh-seven-choices-3",
              "sourceParagraphIds": [
                "block:paper-gaokao-2025-zhejiang-jan:seven-choices:3"
