              "paragraphId": "zh-seven-choices-4",
              "sourceParagraphIds": [
                "block:paper-gaokao-2025-zhejiang-jan:seven-choices:4"
              ],
              "start": 161,
              "end": 223,
              "quote": "当你根据受众的兴趣调整沟通内容时，他们自然会更感兴趣、更投入。直接谈对他们重要的事。这会激发他们理解信息、与信息互动的愿望。"
            },
            {
              "paragraphId": "zh-seven-choices-5",
              "sourceParagraphIds": [
                "block:paper-gaokao-2025-zhejiang-jan:seven-choices:5"
              ],
              "start": 225,
              "end": 240,
              "quote": "● 一个词能说清，就别用十个。"
            },
            {
              "paragraphId": "zh-seven-choices-6",
              "sourceParagraphIds": [
                "block:paper-gaokao-2025-zhejiang-jan:seven-choices:6"
              ],
              "start": 242,
              "end": 318,
              "quote": "即使是最投入、最用心的受众，最终也会厌倦。让信息简单清楚，别人就更容易理解。作为讲话的人，你早就知道自己要说什么。然而，他们是第一次听。所以要保持简单。"
            },
            {
              "paragraphId": "zh-seven-choices-7",
              "sourceParagraphIds": [
                "block:paper-gaokao-2025-zhejiang-jan:seven-choices:7"
              ],
              "start": 320,
              "end": 330,
              "quote": "● 让受众参与进来。"
            },
            {
              "paragraphId": "zh-seven-choices-8",
              "sourceParagraphIds": [
                "block:paper-gaokao-2025-zhejiang-jan:seven-choices:8"
              ],
              "start": 332,
              "end": 435,
              "quote": "如果你当过老师、经理、培训师或教练，你就会知道，学习新知识最好的方法莫过于把它教给别人。请受众贡献自己的想法，或者让他们承担一部分任务，向别人解释新的概念和政策。让他们主持讨论和会议，以培养他们的沟通能力。"
            },
            {
              "paragraphId": "zh-seven-choices-9",
              "sourceParagraphIds": [
                "block:paper-gaokao-2025-zhejiang-jan:seven-choices:9"
              ],
              "start": 437,
              "end": 451,
              "quote": "● 想好传递信息的最佳方式。"
            },
            {
              "paragraphId": "zh-seven-choices-10",
              "sourceParagraphIds": [
                "block:paper-gaokao-2025-zhejiang-jan:seven-choices:10"
